要為電子商務網站打造一個高效、易用且視覺吸引人的前端介面，通常可以遵循以下步驟。這裡以 **React + TypeScript** 為例（你也可以選擇 Vue、Svelte 或純 Vanilla JS），並結合 **Tailwind CSS** 做快速原型設計與樣式管理。

---

## 1️⃣ 規劃階段：需求分析 & 原型設計

| 步驟 | 重點 | 工具建議 |
|------|------|----------|
| 需求梳理 | 確定功能清單（商品列表、搜尋、篩選、購物車、結帳流程、使用者登入/註冊等） | Google Docs / Notion |
| 用戶旅程圖 | 描繪典型使用者在網站上的行為路徑 | Miro / Figma |
| 低保真原型 | 快速畫出頁面佈局、導航結構 | Balsamiq / Figma |
| 高保真設計 | 完整的 UI 設計稿（色彩、字體、按鈕風格） | Figma / Adobe XD |

> **小技巧**：在設計時先決定「主題色」和「字體族」，再統一套用到所有元件，能大幅提升開發效率。

---

## 2️⃣ 技術棧選擇

| 項目 | 推薦技術 | 為什麼選擇 |
|------|----------|------------|
| 前端框架 | React + Vite | 開箱即用、熱更新快、社群龐大 |
| 型別安全 | TypeScript | 減少 bug、提高可維護性 |
| 樣式系統 | Tailwind CSS | 原子化類別、快速迭代 |
| 狀態管理 | Zustand / Redux Toolkit | 輕量、易於測試 |
| 路由 | React Router | SPA 路由控制 |
| API 呼叫 | Axios / Fetch | 支援拦截器、錯誤處理 |
| 表單驗證 | React Hook Form + Zod | 雙向綁定、簡潔驗證 |
| 測試 | Jest + React Testing Library | 單元測試、組件渲染檢查 |
| CI/CD | GitHub Actions | 自動化 lint、build、deploy |
| 部署 | Vercel / Netlify | 靜態部署、CDN 加速 |

> **備註**：如果你想更快上手，也可以直接使用 Next.js，它已經把 SSR、API Routes 等功能打包好。

---

## 3️⃣ 建立專案骨架

```bash
# 使用 Vite + React + TS
npm create vite@latest ecommerce-frontend --template react-ts
cd ecommerce-frontend

# 安裝依賴
npm i tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p

# 安裝狀態管理、表單工具
npm i zustand react-hook-form zod @hookform/resolvers

# 安裝測試工具
npm i -D jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom ts-jest

# 初始化 Tailwind 配置
```

### `tailwind.config.cjs`

```js
module.exports = {
  content: [
    "./index.html",
    "./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}",
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

### `src/main.tsx`

```tsx
import React from 'react'
import ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client'
import App from './App'
import './index.css'   // Tailwind 基礎樣式

ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(
  <React.StrictMode>
    <App />
  </React.StrictMode>
)
```

---

## 4️⃣ 組件化設計

### 4.1 資料結構

```ts
// src/types/index.ts
export interface Product {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  price: number;
  imageUrl: string;
  description: string;
  category: string;
}

export interface CartItem extends Product {
  quantity: number;
}
```

### 4.2 狀態管理（Zustand）

```ts
// src/store/cartStore.ts
import create from 'zustand';
import { CartItem } from '../types';

interface CartState {
  items: CartItem[];
  addToCart: (product: CartItem) => void;
  removeFromCart: (id: string) => void;
  clearCart: () => void;
}

export const useCartStore = create<CartState>((set) => ({
  items: [],
  addToCart: (product) =>
    set((state) => {
      const existing = state.items.find((i) => i.id === product.id);
      if (existing) {
        return {
          items: state.items.map((i) =>
            i.id === product.id ? { ...i, quantity: i.quantity + 1 } : i
          ),
        };
      }
      return { items: [...state.items, { ...product, quantity: 1 }] };
    }),
  removeFromCart: (id) =>
    set((state) => ({ items: state.items.filter((i) => i.id !== id) })),
  clearCart: () => set({ items: [] }),
}));
```

### 4.3 商品卡片（ProductCard）

```tsx
// src/components/ProductCard.tsx
import { Product } from '../types';
import { useCartStore } from '../store/cartStore';

interface Props {
  product: Product;
}

const ProductCard: React.FC<Props> = ({ product }) => {
  const addToCart = useCartStore((state) => state.addToCart);

  return (
    <div className="border rounded-lg p-4 flex flex-col">
      <img src={product.imageUrl} alt={product.name} className="h-48 w-full object-cover mb-4" />
      <h3 className="font-semibold text-lg">{product.name}</h3>
      <p className="text-gray-600">${product.price.toFixed(2)}</p>
      <button
        onClick={() => addToCart(product)}
        className="mt-auto bg-blue-500 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded hover:bg-blue-600"
      >
        加入購物車
      </button>
    </div>
  );
};

export default ProductCard;
```

### 4.4 商品列表（ProductList）

```tsx
// src/pages/ProductList.tsx
import { useEffect, useState } from 'react';
import axios from 'axios';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard';
import { Product } from '../types';

const ProductList: React.FC = () => {
  const [products, setProducts] = useState<Product[]>([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);

  useEffect(() => {
    axios.get('/api/products').then((res) => {
      setProducts(res.data);
      setLoading(false);
    });
  }, []);

  if (loading) return <p>載入中...</p>;

  return (
    <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      {products.map((p) => (
        <ProductCard key={p.id} product={p} />
      ))}
    </div>
  );
};

export default ProductList;
```

> **提示**：若後端 API 尚未完成，可先使用 `json-server` 或 `Mock Service Worker (MSW)` 模擬資料。

---

## 5️⃣ 路由配置

```tsx
// src/App.tsx
import { BrowserRouter as Router, Routes, Route, Link } from 'react-router-dom';
import ProductList from './pages/ProductList';
import CartPage from './pages/CartPage';
import CheckoutPage from './pages/CheckoutPage';

const App: React.FC = () => {
  return (
    <Router>
      <header className="bg-white shadow-md py-4 px-8 flex justify-between items-center">
        <Link to="/" className="text-xl font-bold">MyShop</Link>
        <nav>
          <Link to="/cart" className="ml-4">購物車</Link>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main className="container mx-auto py-8">
        <Routes>
          <Route path="/" element={<ProductList />} />
          <Route path="/cart" element={<CartPage />} />
          <Route path="/checkout" element={<CheckoutPage />} />
        </Routes>
      </main>
    </Router>
  );
};

export default App;
```

---

## 6️⃣ 購物車頁面（CartPage）

```tsx
// src/pages/CartPage.tsx
import { useCartStore } from '../store/cartStore';
import { Link } from 'react-router-dom';

const CartPage: React.FC = () => {
  const { items, removeFromCart, clearCart } = useCartStore();

  const total = items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.quantity, 0);

  if (!items.length) return <p>購物車空空如也。</p>;

  return (
    <div>
      <h2 className="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">購物車</h2>
      <ul className="space-y-4">
        {items.map((item) => (
          <li key={item.id} className="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-4">
            <div className="flex items-center space-x-4">
              <img src={item.imageUrl} alt={item.name} className="w-16 h-16 object-cover" />
              <div>
                <h3>{item.name}</h3>
                <p>${item.price.toFixed(2)} × {item.quantity}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button
              onClick={() => removeFromCart(item.id)}
              className="text-red-500 hover:text-red-700"
            >
              移除
            </button>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <div className="mt-6 flex justify-between items-center">
        <span className="font-semibold text-xl">總計: ${total.toFixed(2)}</span>
        <div>
          <button onClick={clearCart} className="mr-4 bg-gray-300 py-2 px-4 rounded">
            清空購物車
          </button>
          <Link to="/checkout" className="bg-green-500 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded hover:bg-green-600">
            前往結帳
          </Link>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
};

export default CartPage;
```

---

## 7️⃣ 結帳流程（CheckoutPage）

```tsx
// src/pages/CheckoutPage.tsx
import { useForm } from 'react-hook-form';
import { zodResolver } from '@hookform/resolvers/zod';
import { z } from 'zod';
import axios from 'axios';
import { useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';
import { useCartStore } from '../store/cartStore';

const schema = z.object({
  name: z.string().min(1, '請輸入姓名'),
  email: z.string().email('無效的 Email'),
  address: z.string().min(1, '請輸入地址'),
});

type FormData = z.infer<typeof schema>;

const CheckoutPage: React.FC = () => {
  const navigate = useNavigate();
  const { items, clearCart } = useCartStore();
  const { register, handleSubmit, formState: { errors, isSubmitting } } = useForm<FormData>({
    resolver: zodResolver(schema),
  });

  const onSubmit = async (data: FormData) => {
    try {
      await axios.post('/api/orders', {
        customer: data,
        items,
      });
      clearCart();
      navigate('/');
      alert('訂單成功！');
    } catch (err) {
      console.error(err);
      alert('下單失敗，請稍後重試。');
    }
  };

  return (
    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className="max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      <h2 className="text-2xl font-semibold">結帳資訊</h2>

      <div>
        <label className="block mb-1">姓名</label>
        <input {...register('name')} className="w-full border p-2 rounded" />
        {errors.name && <p className="text-red-500">{errors.name.message}</p>}
      </div>

      <div>
        <label className="block mb-1">Email</label>
        <input {...register('email')} className="w-full border p-2 rounded" />
        {errors.email && <p className="text-red-500">{errors.email.message}</p>}
      </div>

      <div>
        <label className="block mb-1">送貨地址</label>
        <textarea {...register('address')} className="w-full border p-2 rounded" rows={3} />
        {errors.address && <p className="text-red-500">{errors.address.message}</p>}
      </div>

      <button
        type="submit"
        disabled={isSubmitting}
        className="bg-blue-500 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded hover:bg-blue-600 disabled:opacity-50"
      >
        {isSubmitting ? '提交中...' : '確認下單'}
      </button>
    </form>
  );
};

export default CheckoutPage;
```

---

## 8️⃣ 測試示例

### 8.1 單元測試（Jest + RTL）

```tsx
// src/__tests__/ProductCard.test.tsx
import { render, screen, fireEvent } from '@testing-library/react';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard';
import { useCartStore } from '../store/cartStore';
import { act } from 'react-dom/test-utils';

jest.mock('../store/cartStore');

describe('ProductCard', () => {
  const mockAddToCart = jest.fn();
  beforeEach(() => {
    (useCartStore as jest.Mock).mockReturnValue({
      addToCart: mockAddToCart,
    });
  });

  it('renders product info and handles click', () => {
    const product = {
      id: '1',
      name: 'Test Shirt',
      price: 29.99,
      imageUrl: '/test.jpg',
      description: '',
      category: '',
    };

    render(<ProductCard product={product} />);
    expect(screen.getByText('Test Shirt')).toBeInTheDocument();
    expect(screen.getByText('$29.99')).toBeInTheDocument();

    const button = screen.getByRole('button', { name: /加入購物車/i });
    fireEvent.click(button);
    expect(mockAddToCart).toHaveBeenCalledWith(product);
  });
});
```

> **備註**：在 `jest.setup.js` 中加上 `import '@testing-library/jest-dom';` 以啟用自訂斷言。

---

## 9️⃣ 部署流程

1. **CI Pipeline**  
   ```yaml
   # .github/workflows/deploy.yml
   name: Deploy Frontend
   on:
     push:
       branches: [ main ]
   jobs:
     build-and-deploy:
       runs-on: ubuntu-latest
       steps:
         - uses: actions/checkout@v3
         - uses: actions/setup-node@v3
           with:
             node-version: '20'
         - run: npm ci
         - run: npm run build
         - uses: vercel/action@v1
           with:
             vercel-token: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}
             vercel-org-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_ORG_ID }}
             vercel-project-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_PROJECT_ID }}
   ```

2. **環境變數**  
   在 Vercel 或 Netlify 的 Dashboard 設定 `VITE_API_URL` 指向你的後端 API。

3. **HTTPS & CDN**  
   Vercel/Netlify 會自動提供 HTTPS 與全球 CDN，確保速度與安全。

